name=Viewpoint Geometry Fix (Diagnostics)
id=ViewpointGeometryFix
author=ViewpointGeometryFix contributors
modversion=0.3.0-test
require=\ZombieBuddy
javaJarFile=media/java/client/ViewpointGeometryFix.jar
javaPkgName=vpgeometryfix
ZBVersionMin=2.3.2
description=TEST BUILD with a switchable roof fix for Project Viewpoint (in-game window button "Dach-Fix"): adds the missing back halves of steep roofs (mirrored front half with its texture), trims oversized roof slabs to their tile, puts gable trims into the gable plane, and gives roof tiles without a 3D shape the shape of the sibling tileset. Changes only Viewpoint's first-person meshes at runtime - no game/Viewpoint files, saves or gameplay. Also a diagnostic companion: detects Viewpoint, ZombieBuddy and the game version, logs [VPGeometryFix] lines and writes roof data reports. In-game window and world right-click menu "VPGeometryFix"; no default hotkeys.
